filmed by the carabinieri.

00:20:29.623 --> 00:20:32.900
They were found in 2
perfectly concealed hiding places,

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.493
in the basement of a house,
under a removable staircase.

00:20:42.230 --> 00:20:43.877
And in this false ceiling.

00:20:45.280 --> 00:20:49.607
To escape the police, the mafiosi
often resort to these bunkers.

00:20:49.930 --> 00:20:53.437
They can spend several
months, even years.

00:20:55.050 --> 00:20:59.370
On the other side of the parking lot, Matteo
and his men in turn discover,

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:01.560
the identity of the mafioso they are going to arrest.

00:21:01.560 --> 00:21:03.480
Leonardo Capo Greco.

00:21:04.720 --> 00:21:08.863
At 38, he belongs to a family
of Cidernos, the Commissos.

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:12.850
He is wanted for corruption
and extortion.

00:21:12.850 --> 00:21:15.130
He would be his clan's accountant.

00:21:17.183 --> 00:21:20.450
- These are figures
important parts of the Ndrangheta.

00:21:23.020 --> 00:21:28.270
The police will intervene simultaneously,
to prevent information from circulating,

00:21:28.270 --> 00:21:31.790
and that certain suspects
escape the dragnet.

00:21:31.990 --> 00:21:35.730
At the time of departure,
It’s time for final instructions.

00:21:36.790 --> 00:21:41.080
- You will stay with him from
moment when we enter, when he goes to pee,

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:43.510
when he goes to change,
when he packs his bag.

00:21:47.657 --> 00:21:51.370
- We are going to an area of ​​Calabria
where this clan we're going to hit

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:53.327
already has a past, a history.

00:21:56.380 --> 00:22:00.054
Its members were involved
in many surveys.

00:22:01.570 --> 00:22:05.440
The police do not wear vests
bulletproof or heavy weapons.

00:22:05.440 --> 00:22:07.900
The mafiosi put up no resistance.

00:22:07.900 --> 00:22:13.230
They leave it to their armies of lawyers
care to get them out of prison gently.

00:22:15.700 --> 00:22:20.010
Around sixty police cars
leave the parking lot in column.

00:22:20.320 --> 00:22:24.700
200 men from the criminal brigade
rush across Calabria.

00:22:27.480 --> 00:22:30.227
1 hour later, the vehicles disperse,

00:22:30.360 --> 00:22:32.660
to reach the 3 targeted cities.

00:22:34.693 --> 00:22:37.627
Leonardo Capo Greco
lives in this large villa.

00:22:45.060 --> 00:22:50.130
The police may be discreet,
the neighbors' dog notices their presence.

00:22:50.130 --> 00:22:53.154
They must quickly
enter the garden.

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:55.080
You have to climb the gate.

00:23:05.460 --> 00:23:08.820
This police officer is responsible for monitoring
the back of the house.

00:23:25.250 --> 00:23:28.380
In front of the house, 3 men
are on the front line.

00:23:30.050 --> 00:23:34.460
A fourth remains behind.
He watches for any movement at the windows.

00:23:42.940 --> 00:23:45.940
- We are the police.
- That's what I see.

00:23:45.940 --> 00:23:49.180
- We need to do a search.
- You are welcome.

00:23:49.180 --> 00:23:52.660
- You're alone at home ?
- Yes.

00:23:53.930 --> 00:23:58.217
Despite this nocturnal irruption,
Leonardo Capo Greco appears serene.

00:23:59.060 --> 00:24:02.840
In the house everything seems calm,
but the police remain vigilant.

00:24:05.300 --> 00:24:09.980
- Do you have weapons at home?
- No. I have a gun permit,

00:24:09.980 --> 00:24:11.627
but there is none here.

00:24:14.210 --> 00:24:16.160
Investigators search the house.

00:24:16.190 --> 00:24:19.310
If this man works
officially in the construction industry,

00:24:19.310 --> 00:24:23.847
he is suspected of laundering
part of the Ndrangheta fortune.

00:24:24.920 --> 00:24:27.827
He probably doesn't hide any money at home.

00:24:27.827 --> 00:24:31.250
The investigators are rather at
search for accounting documents,

00:24:31.250 --> 00:24:33.267
which would prove money laundering.

00:24:38.920 --> 00:24:42.466
We found elements
who can serve us,

00:24:43.450 --> 00:24:48.007
but generally, for all good
check, we need more time.

00:24:49.507 --> 00:24:50.527
So at the office,

00:24:51.070 --> 00:24:55.803
we can calmly watch everything
equipment that we take with us.

00:24:58.730 --> 00:25:02.323
Capo Greco is taken towards
The police headquarters.

00:25:05.890 --> 00:25:10.753
At the same time, 5 kilometers away,
the men of the criminal brigade,

00:25:11.170 --> 00:25:15.370
take stock with police officers
uniform who have just scouted the scene.

00:25:15.370 --> 00:25:20.950
They will question the one who is designated
as the godfather of the Salvatore Aquino clan.

00:25:21.820 --> 00:25:26.290
- Are there surveillance cameras?
- There are lights everywhere.

00:25:31.090 --> 00:25:35.783
There are big white spotlights.
They light up the entrance to the building.

00:25:44.290 --> 00:25:46.450
Direction the Godfather's residence.

00:25:50.120 --> 00:25:51.860
On the spot, surprise.

00:25:51.860 --> 00:25:55.340
The mafioso who would be sitting on
tens of millions of euros,

00:25:55.340 --> 00:25:58.227
acquired illegally,
does not own a palace.

00:25:58.580 --> 00:26:03.390
He preferred to build
a building to accommodate his entire family.

00:26:05.090 --> 00:26:09.650
He is content with a modest apartment
on the third floor in the area.

00:26:09.650 --> 00:26:13.540
Mafia bosses are discreet,
but only on the front.

00:26:16.047 --> 00:26:18.540
- Search.
- Do you have a warrant?

00:26:21.210 --> 00:26:23.297
- Yes, you can get dressed.

00:26:33.240 --> 00:26:36.927
The man we arrest looks like
to a quiet grandfather,

00:26:37.560 --> 00:26:41.803
far from the image of the mafioso in a suit
striped, a cigar in his mouth.

00:26:42.000 --> 00:26:44.850
At home, no weapons, no bodyguards.

00:26:45.150 --> 00:26:48.600
For 2 hours, the police
go get documents,

00:26:48.600 --> 00:26:51.477
proving that they are rigging public markets.

00:26:57.980 --> 00:26:59.800
- We'll take you to the office.

00:27:00.320 --> 00:27:02.517
Direction the anti-mafia service.

00:27:14.320 --> 00:27:15.970
It's 7 a.m.

00:27:16.600 --> 00:27:19.090
Return to Reggio di Calabria.

00:27:19.090 --> 00:27:23.047
The 29 arrested were
taken back to police headquarters,

00:27:23.047 --> 00:27:26.980
before which they gathered
families and friends of the suspects.

00:27:26.980 --> 00:27:28.540
They are going to be imprisoned.

00:27:28.540 --> 00:27:32.560
But before that, justice makes them
parade in front of the cameras.

00:27:32.590 --> 00:27:34.270
In order of importance.

00:27:35.260 --> 00:27:39.220
A staging which is also
a communication operation,

00:27:39.220 --> 00:27:42.234
intended for all
Calabrian society.

00:27:42.680 --> 00:27:48.497
Salvatore Aquino, the alleged godfather, is the
1ᵉʳ to be exhibited in front of the Italian media.

00:27:53.680 --> 00:27:57.340
Leonardo Capo Greco is going out,
him, in fourth position.

00:27:58.523 --> 00:28:01.030
They are all accused
aggravated extortion,

00:28:01.030 --> 00:28:05.553
and rigging of public markets,
but above all of mafia association.

00:28:07.900 --> 00:28:10.217
A crime that only exists in Italy.

00:28:10.330 --> 00:28:14.410
This allows a person to be convicted
as soon as a link is established between it,

00:28:14.410 --> 00:28:16.473
and a criminal organization.

00:28:16.780 --> 00:28:19.293
Punishment then incurred: 15 years in prison.

00:28:28.770 --> 00:28:32.620
Prosecutor Gratery invited
around thirty journalists,

00:28:32.820 --> 00:28:34.810
for a press conference.

00:28:37.380 --> 00:28:39.870
Here it doesn't happen
just like in France.

00:28:39.870 --> 00:28:44.367
Full details of the operation
of the night will be reviewed.

00:28:44.520 --> 00:28:46.550
The identities of those arrested,

00:28:48.150 --> 00:28:52.427
the reason for their indictment,
will be delivered to journalists.

00:28:54.360 --> 00:28:57.163
The moment is historic for the prosecutor.

00:28:59.220 --> 00:29:02.760
- It's a great day for
the prosecution and the police.

00:29:02.760 --> 00:29:05.797
The members of the Ndrangheta,
arrested last night,

00:29:06.030 --> 00:29:09.083
are great figures
Calabrian octopus.

00:29:19.470 --> 00:29:23.313
Every mass arrest
offers the prosecutor a platform,

00:29:23.580 --> 00:29:26.040
to address public opinion.

00:29:26.473 --> 00:29:31.710
Faced with the most powerful mafia in the world,
Nicolas Gratery wants to get the message across,

00:29:31.710 --> 00:29:34.417
that the Italian State is present in Calabria.

00:29:35.006 --> 00:29:38.237
- If we do these press conferences,
it's to tell people,

00:29:38.237 --> 00:29:41.100
that they can trust
in us, that the State exists,

00:29:41.100 --> 00:29:44.970
that they should go to the police,
the Guardia di Finanza and the carabinieri,

00:29:44.970 --> 00:29:46.750
to denounce the mafiosi.

00:29:48.210 --> 00:29:53.090
Around twenty people arrested
that night and still in prison.

00:29:53.130 --> 00:29:58.277
On the other hand, Salvatore Aquino, the boss
presumed, was released 1 month later.

00:29:58.410 --> 00:30:03.430
As usual, his lawyers found
the flaw, the good procedural flaw.

00:30:15.340 --> 00:30:20.711
50 kilometers from Reggio, in the city
from Palmi, a man saw a lump in his stomach.

00:30:25.460 --> 00:30:28.670
We will meet him
in this strange building.

00:30:30.690 --> 00:30:34.837
38 surveillance cameras,
barbed wire on the surrounding walls,

00:30:36.570 --> 00:30:39.453
and elite armed police officers in the courtyard.

00:30:43.820 --> 00:30:48.100
We are at Gaetano Saffioti,
his house became his prison.

00:30:49.580 --> 00:30:51.773
Gaetano has a wife and a child.

00:30:52.430 --> 00:30:54.170
We will not film them.

00:30:54.170 --> 00:30:58.527
He doesn't want to put them in danger
because there is a price on his head.

00:31:01.973 --> 00:31:04.873
- Coffee, you take it
still at home?

00:31:05.057 --> 00:31:06.860
- Yes.
- Never at the bar?

00:31:07.820 --> 00:31:13.850
- I can't go to the bar anymore.
My situation is a bit complicated.

00:31:15.410 --> 00:31:20.277
Many bars don't accept you because
they fear there will be an attack.

00:31:20.277 --> 00:31:24.110
And then we put the other customers in
embarrassment, we should clear the bar

00:31:24.110 --> 00:31:26.183
and that's a bit complicated.

00:31:27.860 --> 00:31:31.130
Gaetano runs a business
who makes concrete.

00:31:31.280 --> 00:31:33.830
He is threatened with death by the Ndrangheta.

00:31:34.280 --> 00:31:38.870
He's what the mobsters call
an infamous one for having broken the omerta,

00:31:38.870 --> 00:31:40.130
the law of silence.

00:31:40.520 --> 00:31:44.363
To survive, he had to transform
his bunker dwelling.

00:31:46.310 --> 00:31:50.313
- That's armored glass
bulletproof weapons.

00:31:51.380 --> 00:31:54.833
It allows me to enjoy my coffee
without being in danger.

00:31:55.400 --> 00:31:59.820
- You mean risk-free?
- Without the risk of an attack occurring.

00:31:59.820 --> 00:32:02.810
- Since when,
do you live behind this glass?

00:32:02.810 --> 00:32:05.840
- It's been 12 years, 9 months
and 23 days today.

00:32:05.840 --> 00:32:10.100
But it's been 12 years, 9 months and 23
days that I feel like a free man.

00:32:10.100 --> 00:32:13.760
It may seem paradoxical,
but before, it was hell.

00:32:16.330 --> 00:32:21.530
The authorities suggested other
parades to thwart all types of attacks.

00:32:25.450 --> 00:32:28.403
- On this side which gives
directly on the road.

00:32:32.250 --> 00:32:34.290
We had to raise the wall.

00:32:36.780 --> 00:32:41.730
And we reinforced it with a wall
made of iron to protect us from bullets,

00:32:41.730 --> 00:32:43.840
which would be taken from the street.

00:32:46.650 --> 00:32:49.920
At the top we had to cover
with a kind of roof,

00:32:49.920 --> 00:32:52.613
to prevent someone from throwing a bomb.

00:32:52.890 --> 00:32:55.540
It all started in the early 2000s.

00:32:55.920 --> 00:33:00.330
It has been 20 years since Gaetano
pay the pizzo, the mafia tax.

00:33:01.290 --> 00:33:05.400
- He used to come, he used to sit here,
he called: “Prepare the money.”

00:33:08.910 --> 00:33:12.930
You had to prepare the money.
- And you had to pay in cash?

00:33:12.930 --> 00:33:16.260
- In cash, of course, it does not
should not leave any traces.

00:33:16.260 --> 00:33:19.680
He sat down in one of his chairs,
I had already prepared the money.

00:33:19.680 --> 00:33:21.630
I took it and gave it.

00:33:23.010 --> 00:33:24.420
It's 2001.

00:33:24.450 --> 00:33:27.863
The Ndrangheta has already
extorted 2 million euros,

00:33:28.380 --> 00:33:32.113
at many times,
Gaetano tried not to pay,

00:33:32.430 --> 00:33:35.580
but the mafia families,
systematically punished,

00:33:35.580 --> 00:33:37.430
his attempts at rebellion.

00:33:38.820 --> 00:33:42.990
- This is one of the trucks that was
burned. That's when I was being deceitful.

00:33:42.990 --> 00:33:44.190
I wasn't paying.

00:33:46.050 --> 00:33:48.420
And they responded with retaliation.

00:33:48.420 --> 00:33:51.637
He set fire to trucks,
to excavators.

00:33:54.150 --> 00:33:58.590
In all, there are around thirty
construction vehicles that were destroyed.

00:33:58.590 --> 00:34:02.220
One of his employees had to
even set fire to his machine,

00:34:02.220 --> 00:34:06.580
while a big arm of the mafia
pointed a gun at his head.

00:34:07.830 --> 00:34:11.857
The more time passed, the more
the amounts requested increased.

00:34:12.570 --> 00:34:16.560
Exasperated, Gaetano alone finally decides to react.

00:34:19.050 --> 00:34:22.846
- That's a camera
monitoring inserted into the wall,

00:34:23.130 --> 00:34:25.770
and which I used to record
all appointments,

00:34:25.770 --> 00:34:29.590
that I was obliged to have
with the men of the Ndrangheta.

00:34:32.180 --> 00:34:35.747
For months he recorded
extortion scenes.

00:34:38.710 --> 00:34:42.780
In addition to paying the pizzo to
the Palmi family where he works,

00:34:43.030 --> 00:34:46.630
he must also pay back money
to the clan of Rosarno and Gioia Tauro,

00:34:46.630 --> 00:34:48.910
who had control over neighboring towns,

00:34:48.910 --> 00:34:52.610
that he crossed to deliver
materials to its customers.

00:34:55.810 --> 00:35:00.010
This is the particularity of the Ndrangheta,
unlike other mafias,

00:35:00.010 --> 00:35:02.500
where there is a leader,
for the entire organization,

00:35:02.500 --> 00:35:06.403
in Calabria, the region is divided
in more than 160 territories,

00:35:06.970 --> 00:35:11.057
with a leader per sector. There is
a tax per territory crossed.

00:35:11.710 --> 00:35:14.377
Gaetano was thus extorted by 3 clans.

00:35:17.790 --> 00:35:21.120
- 3 times for the same work
to 3 different clans.

00:35:21.350 --> 00:35:25.790
That's how it works. It is
as if you were going to a foreign country,

00:35:25.790 --> 00:35:29.187
where we pay customs correctly
because we cross it.

00:35:30.230 --> 00:35:33.907
Gaetano thus accumulates several
recording hours,

00:35:34.190 --> 00:35:39.167
dozens of examples of his hell
every day, at any time of the day.

00:35:42.900 --> 00:35:47.797
- I open the drawer, I take a wad
of 10 million lire at the time.

00:35:48.780 --> 00:35:52.593
And I put it on the table
even showing it on camera.

00:35:55.820 --> 00:35:58.973
10 million lire, or more than €7,000.

00:35:59.990 --> 00:36:04.160
To be sure to convince justice,
Gaetano puts a battle plan in place.

00:36:04.160 --> 00:36:05.867
He takes all the risks.

00:36:08.057 --> 00:36:10.260
Here he intentionally shows the camera,

00:36:10.260 --> 00:36:14.370
that he is holding a wad of notes
in the hand, proof of extortion.

00:36:14.370 --> 00:36:19.154
But one day, a mafioso realizes
that something has changed in his office.

00:36:19.373 --> 00:36:22.903
- He realizes that there is a
surveillance camera and he says to me:

00:36:22.903 --> 00:36:27.280
“That’s your problem, what do I think?
have to do with a surveillance camera?"

00:36:27.280 --> 00:36:29.197
The man warns Gaetano.

00:36:29.710 --> 00:36:34.120
He leaves it there, because he is convinced
that he is afraid, that he will do nothing,

00:36:34.120 --> 00:36:37.193
that omerta, like
always, will impose itself on him.

00:36:38.260 --> 00:36:41.750
Except that Gaetano decides
to break the law of silence.

00:36:42.460 --> 00:36:45.190
He delivers his recordings to justice.

00:36:45.400 --> 00:36:50.373
48 members of 3 families are arrested
and sentenced to up to 16 years in prison.

00:36:52.140 --> 00:36:56.670
The police will also seize for 50
million euros worth of real estate.

00:36:56.670 --> 00:37:00.780
This dragnet marks the beginning of
pressure for him to retract.

00:37:00.780 --> 00:37:02.970
And death threats against him.

00:37:04.830 --> 00:37:08.790
- “Very soon you will receive in the body
45 fragments of p**** bullet.

00:37:08.790 --> 00:37:12.000
That way you won't get bored
from Palmi, but from the earth."

00:37:12.030 --> 00:37:13.620
- Is this a clear threat?

00:37:13.620 --> 00:37:18.221
- A clear threat, a bullet
pistol for each person arrested.

00:37:18.750 --> 00:37:24.180
The Ndrangheta, established everywhere, is
pressure on its customers and suppliers.

00:37:24.180 --> 00:37:28.177
Gaetano's company loses
90% of its turnover.

00:37:29.520 --> 00:37:32.340
- Just after the denunciations,
it was the apocalypse.

00:37:32.340 --> 00:37:34.230
Everyone has disappeared, the workers,

00:37:34.230 --> 00:37:37.750
banks, suppliers,
the customers, the desert.

00:37:52.480 --> 00:37:56.290
Gaetano has become what we
calls Calabria an infamous person.

00:37:56.650 --> 00:38:00.073
And yet, 13 years
later he feels free.

00:38:03.393 --> 00:38:06.370
- That's my life, she
is reduced to around twenty steps.

00:38:06.370 --> 00:38:12.160
This is the distance from my house
and my office after having had my coffee,

00:38:12.160 --> 00:38:15.960
This is the only journey I take,
from one building to another.

00:38:17.560 --> 00:38:20.830
It is the life of the one who
chose to live legally.

00:38:20.830 --> 00:38:24.451
It's the price to pay, but
I'm happy to pay it.

00:38:36.650 --> 00:38:40.367
Thanks to all these protections,
Gaetano continues to live,

00:38:40.550 --> 00:38:42.466
but he is locked up at home.

00:38:43.550 --> 00:38:48.077
This is an isolated case in Calabria,
because there, those who defy the mafia,

00:38:48.260 --> 00:38:49.677
pay for it with their lives.

00:38:50.710 --> 00:38:52.503
Just in Siderno,

00:38:53.087 --> 00:38:56.380
32 recent assassinations,
are still not elucidated.

00:38:56.590 --> 00:39:01.147
The Ndrangheta is suspected every time
times, but no one testifies.

00:39:02.980 --> 00:39:08.080
Mario goes to this cemetery 4
times a week for 10 years now.

00:39:08.080 --> 00:39:12.460
He can't mourn
his son shot in the head.

00:39:14.387 --> 00:39:17.693
- The marble is missing,
I didn't want to wear it.

00:39:18.730 --> 00:39:22.227
It's like it's all over,
if I set the marble.

00:39:23.920 --> 00:39:26.400
This grave will always remain like this.

00:39:27.700 --> 00:39:31.340
Mainly because
It’s a life that’s been stolen.

00:39:35.110 --> 00:39:39.907
Mario devotes his life to memory
of his son so that justice can be done.

00:39:41.300 --> 00:39:45.787
Gianluca died for defending
his father-in-law who was a racketeer.

00:39:47.270 --> 00:39:51.783
- In all cars and family,
there are photos of Gianluca.

00:39:52.680 --> 00:39:56.037
Unlike many
families from Siderno,

00:39:56.037 --> 00:40:00.330
Mario decided not to put
the veil on the murder of Gianluca.

00:40:00.960 --> 00:40:05.500
So that the murderer is condemned,
Mario became a civil party,

00:40:05.500 --> 00:40:07.190
something rare in the region.

00:40:08.473 --> 00:40:12.633
Today the murderer risks
to leave for procedural violation.

00:40:13.140 --> 00:40:18.743
For Mario to withdraw from the appeal trial,
the Ndrangheta, is putting pressure again.

00:40:21.660 --> 00:40:24.663
- As I was threatened, thanks to these cameras,

00:40:25.080 --> 00:40:28.110
I can control what
happens in front of my house,

00:40:28.110 --> 00:40:29.543
and who enters my house.

00:40:31.170 --> 00:40:34.853
The clan that killed his son
increases intimidation,

00:40:35.220 --> 00:40:39.270
since the start of the procedure
judicial, almost 10 years ago.

00:40:39.270 --> 00:40:40.520
- Do you see there?

00:40:42.930 --> 00:40:46.680
- What is this ?
- These are projectile holes.

00:40:46.680 --> 00:40:49.573
- And who shot?
- We don't know who shot.

