00:45:19.480 --> 00:45:23.197
- Why didn't you
managed to complete the project?

00:45:23.197 --> 00:45:25.077
- Because they arrested me.

00:45:25.810 --> 00:45:27.653
The magistrates arrested me.

00:45:29.260 --> 00:45:33.267
It's all a conspiracy of the
politics and the judiciary.

00:45:34.420 --> 00:45:38.500
This car dealership would not
so what an honest businessman?

00:45:38.500 --> 00:45:44.440
And yet, he risks 15 years in prison for
