00:46:11.260 --> 00:46:15.130
Claude Chevalanidi is a
poor suburb of the city,

00:46:15.130 --> 00:46:19.120
an abandoned place where homes
rub shoulders with unfinished buildings,

00:46:19.120 --> 00:46:20.320
