00:46:44.050 --> 00:46:48.187
It's Vincenzo, the director,
who now uses this house.

00:46:50.650 --> 00:46:52.876
- This is the view from the terrace.

00:46:53.320 --> 00:46:56.830
- This allowed the boss to
monitor its entire territory.

00:46:56.830 --> 00:46:58.160
- Certainly yes.

00:46:59.380 --> 00:47:02.820
It had a panoramic view
very complete of the area.

00:47:07.090 --> 00:47:10.690
The best materials were
used such as marble,

00:47:10.690 --> 00:47:13.427
from floor to ceiling in this bathroom.

00:47:15.040 --> 00:47:18.743
- This is the bathroom
that he was being built,

00:47:20.577 --> 00:47:22.170
with a view of the sea.

00:47:24.160 --> 00:47:28.004
For 2 months, Vincenzo and his
colleagues from the Observatory,

00:47:28.004 --> 00:47:31.150
receive here minors who
had to deal with the law.

00:47:31.150 --> 00:47:34.570
These young people dealt
drugs or stole a car.

00:47:37.900 --> 00:47:40.690
Most of them border the Ndrangheta
