00:47:46.240 --> 00:47:48.910
Its goal is to break
the image of the mafia,

00:47:48.910 --> 00:47:50.590
and its promises of easy money.

00:47:52.630 --> 00:47:55.553
- Here is one of the places
the most importants,

00:47:55.603 --> 00:47:59.837
the place where most
fleeing criminals are hiding.

00:48:00.280 --> 00:48:02.440
To create a spark among young people,

00:48:02.470 --> 00:48:05.860
Vincenzo makes them in particular
visit a secret room.

00:48:07.480 --> 00:48:13.027
- It's more than important, it's symbolic,
because it represents a way of life,

00:48:13.210 --> 00:48:14.867
which is often mythologized.

00:48:17.200 --> 00:48:21.430
We try, before demystifying it,
to make people understand that being a boss,

00:48:21.430 --> 00:48:24.623
a mafioso, is not
an enviable thing at all.

00:48:27.250 --> 00:48:30.753
At the foot of this ladder, a small
room of 10 square meters,

00:48:30.753 --> 00:48:34.893
with rudimentary comfort.
The godfather had also planned a bunker.

00:48:35.290 --> 00:48:37.790
Incarcerated, he was never able to complete it.

00:48:37.960 --> 00:48:42.410
Vincenzo made the replica there
from a famous hiding place in Calabria.

00:48:45.500 --> 00:48:50.314
- It is a fairly faithful reconstruction
from a bunker from 10 or 15 years ago.

00:48:53.490 --> 00:48:57.060
Used by Bellocchio,
a mafioso from Rosarno.

00:48:59.640 --> 00:49:02.990
When we found him,
we saw this sentence on the wall:

00:49:04.110 --> 00:49:06.584
“God, protect me in this bunker.”

00:49:08.700 --> 00:49:12.890
And he had hung all these
holy images that protected him.

00:49:14.040 --> 00:49:18.460
He also had these wolves, because in
the mafia, they nicknamed him The Wolf.

00:49:18.990 --> 00:49:20.767
What do you guys say?

00:49:24.950 --> 00:49:28.100
- It was certainly,
a difficult lifestyle.

00:49:29.190 --> 00:49:30.720
Really ugly.

00:49:32.180 --> 00:49:34.457
For me, it's like detention.

00:49:35.060 --> 00:49:37.937
It's living underground.
It's a rat's life.

00:49:40.010 --> 00:49:44.170
Vincenzo addresses the delicate subject
