you completely lose your freedom.

00:49:52.910 --> 00:49:54.523
You no longer belong to you.

00:49:56.060 --> 00:49:58.340
You belong to another person.

00:49:58.340 --> 00:50:02.600
Your freedom, your lifestyle is
completely dependent on a third party.

00:50:02.930 --> 00:50:06.397
- Your person no longer exists,
she is submissive to the boss.

00:50:09.080 --> 00:50:11.770
- But according to you, what is fascinating?

00:50:14.090 --> 00:50:18.424
- It's having money, a reputation,
have everything you want.

00:50:18.560 --> 00:50:22.400
Because for a boy our age,
have money or a nice car

00:50:22.400 --> 00:50:26.240
in this period, and very
few people can afford it.

00:50:26.240 --> 00:50:30.110
And it’s also to stand out,
to appear as the greatest.

00:50:30.110 --> 00:50:31.440
That’s what’s fascinating.

00:50:33.500 --> 00:50:38.223
Vincenzo does prevention by
exploiting the assets seized from the mafiosi.

00:50:42.260 --> 00:50:47.160
Another man grabbed it for them
grow and create jobs.

00:50:47.540 --> 00:50:49.820
His name is Pino Demazzi.

00:50:53.193 --> 00:50:57.510
In Italy, everyone knows him,
because he was the first priest,

00:50:57.510 --> 00:51:00.330
