00:51:15.860 --> 00:51:18.790
Today, Pino Demazzi continues the affront.

00:51:18.890 --> 00:51:23.634
He created a cooperative which manages and
exploits assets seized from the mafia.

00:51:24.440 --> 00:51:28.346
- Confiscated land that
now manages the cooperative,

00:51:28.780 --> 00:51:32.940
all belonged to families
very important of the Ndrangheta.

00:51:35.360 --> 00:51:39.290
Only well-known names which today
