the Ndrangheta on employees.

00:52:00.110 --> 00:52:04.400
- People sometimes say: "But you are
mad! What did you go do?”

00:52:04.400 --> 00:52:08.504
But in the end, this is the result
who counts, we create work.

00:52:08.870 --> 00:52:12.740
Fear is just a feeling
and a feeling can be controlled.

00:52:14.180 --> 00:52:17.120
Warnings are not
not empty words.

00:52:17.120 --> 00:52:20.617
The mafia has already taken action,
she no longer lets go of Pino Demazzi,

00:52:20.617 --> 00:52:23.707
since he recovered
neighboring olive groves.

00:52:24.090 --> 00:52:27.523
Pino finds Domenico,
the president of the cooperative

00:52:33.440 --> 00:52:35.907
- We have just finished picking.

00:52:36.860 --> 00:52:40.040
He wants to show us
the traces of reprisals.

00:52:40.040 --> 00:52:42.770
- Look, here, we see
still the old strain.

00:52:42.770 --> 00:52:45.487
We put dirt on it.

00:52:46.503 --> 00:52:50.604
Here, just before confiscation
definitive, before the assignment,

00:52:51.620 --> 00:52:56.750
they came here with trucks,
chainsaws and cut down these trees.

00:52:56.750 --> 00:52:59.243
Trees centuries old.

00:52:59.570 --> 00:53:02.477
Some were very high, 10 to 15 meters.

00:53:03.950 --> 00:53:07.160
6 years ago, the Ndrangheta
cut in one night,

00:53:07.760 --> 00:53:12.590
these 640 ancestral olive trees for
leave nothing to Pino Demazzi.

00:53:13.190 --> 00:53:16.787
The mafia would have resold
