00:53:19.730 --> 00:53:23.027
3 years ago, the mafia again
tried to make him understand,

00:53:23.027 --> 00:53:25.143
that these lands belonged to him.

00:53:27.310 --> 00:53:32.653
This olive grove suffered a sad fate.
Hundreds of trees were burned.

00:53:33.440 --> 00:53:37.100
The godfathers of the local clan who
had organized these destructions,

00:53:37.100 --> 00:53:40.490
