from prison last year.

00:53:40.490 --> 00:53:44.693
But these heavy sentences did not
not calmed the anger of Pino Demazzi.

00:53:47.200 --> 00:53:50.270
- Finding yourself face to face with
land in this state,

00:53:51.560 --> 00:53:54.920
see things like that,
it makes you angry.

00:53:58.100 --> 00:54:02.403
Cutting down trees does not mean
not only the money goes to us.

00:54:04.550 --> 00:54:05.450
That means :

00:54:06.380 --> 00:54:09.460
"These trees are ours,
and no one else."

00:54:14.480 --> 00:54:18.260
With thousands of young people
unemployed, often adrift,

00:54:18.260 --> 00:54:22.333
