to disappear from the Calabrian landscape.

00:54:24.560 --> 00:54:29.390
Unless she finds on her way
a new major enemy, the Church.

00:54:29.390 --> 00:54:33.110
Pope Francis visited
in Calabria last year.

00:54:34.510 --> 00:54:36.257
- The Ndrangheta.

00:54:36.980 --> 00:54:40.447
It is the worship of evil,
against the common good.

00:54:41.510 --> 00:54:45.993
They are not in communion with
God, they are excommunicated.

00:54:47.466 --> 00:54:52.243
Excommunication is an infamy,
the worst punishment for these criminals,

00:54:52.243 --> 00:54:55.930
